  "created": "2026-10-25T21:30:39.187Z",
  "description": "HiQPdf Next Classic Compatibility Library for .NET lets an application written for the classic HiQPdf HTML to PDF Converter for .NET (the HiQPdf package) run on the HiQPdf Next Library for .NET without code changes. The package keeps the classic HiQPdf namespace and its public types (HtmlToPdf, HtmlToImage, PdfDocument, PdfPage, the drawable and HTML objects, canvases, forms, outlines and security settings) and renders with the Chromium-based engine of HiQPdf Next.\n\nReplace the classic package reference with this package and add the HiQPdf Next HTML to PDF package of the platform the application runs on: HiQPdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.Windows, HiQPdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.Linux, HiQPdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.MacOS or the multi-platform metapackage HiQPdf.Next.HtmlToPdf. The license key is set as before.\n\nThe converters hand over the HiQPdf Next converter before each conversion, for the options the classic API has no setting for, so the native API can be used alongside the classic one and the application can move to it gradually.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* .NET 10.0, 9.0, 8.0, 7.0, 6.0 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Windows, Linux and macOS\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications",
